					"text" : "D4.mask.calculator calculates spatialization mask based on the incoming matrix\n\nOPTIONAL ARGUMENTS: bus name (a.k.a. context) (null or main out by default)\n                                            0/1 toggles local output only (does not send back to D4-calc~)\n\nINLETS:\n1 - Incoming jit.matrix.\n2 - Set the bus to monitor and whose mask should be altered.\n3 - Incoming med data.\n4 - Sending 1 calculates the mask, 0 and any other number are ignored.\n     IMPORTANT! This calculation takes place only after the next matrix is received.\n5 - Bang calculates and outputs the mask based on the current matrix."
				}

			}
